      "content": "It's completely understandable that constant doom news can make planning feel hopeless when the future seems uncertain. Many people find meaning by focusing on small, immediate actions you can take today instead of trying to predict a collapse you can't stop. Staying present by building a meaningful life now is often the only path that remains within your control.",
